* MAX44245 Non-Inverting Amplifier
VIN IN 0 SINE(0 50m 1k) AC 1
VCC VCC 0 15
VEE VEE 0 -15

* Feedback network for a gain of 20 V/V (1 + 19k/1k)
R1 V_neg 0 1k
R2 OUT V_neg 19k

* Op-Amp instantiation (assuming standard 5-pin order: IN+ IN- V+ V- OUT)
X1 IN V_neg VCC VEE OUT MAX44245

* Library inclusion
.lib MAX44245.lib

* Analysis directives
.tran 0 5m 0 1u
.ac dec 10 100 10k

* Measurement for the gain in dB at 1 kHz
.meas AC gain_db FIND 20*log10(mag(V(OUT))) AT 1k

.end
